# Vendored third-party assets must stay byte-for-byte identical to the upstream
# builds they were downloaded from — that is what lets us verify them against the
# published SRI hashes. Line-ending conversion would silently change their bytes,
# so check them out exactly as committed on every platform.
omnimove-backend/src/main/resources/static/vendor/** -text

# Binary formats: never diff or convert.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
